WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.958
MY BELOVED DEMON

2
00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:49.090
Mr. Jeong Koo Won.

3
00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:52.635
<i>Today I make the biggest bet of my life</i>

4
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.512
<i>on this man.</i>

5
00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:58.183
marry me

6
00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.383
I don't want to

7
00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.768
Why not? Just marry her.

8
00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.315
<i>It was the worst bet.</i>

9
00:01:54.239 --> 00:01:55.406
To Hee

10
00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.783
Don't say anything.

11
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:08.628
Why are you following me now?

12
00:02:08.711 --> 00:02:09.921
To protect you.

13
00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:11.256
I am your bodyguard.

14
00:02:14.217 --> 00:02:16.469
I do not mix work and personal life.

15
00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:21.808
I must have gone crazy.

16
00:02:45.915 --> 00:02:52.088
EPISODE 4
SWEET AND DANGEROUS

17
00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.424
- I want to hold!
- No!

18
00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.801
{\an8}- Let me hold!
- I say, no!

19
00:02:56.885 --> 00:02:58.011
{\an8}Yes, yes.

20
00:03:13.776 --> 00:03:14.819
{\an8}She is incredible!

21
00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.030
{\an8}Did you see it?

22
00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:20.533
{\an8}She confessed to him
just in front of us to tease.

23
00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:29.876
My own mother stuck a knife in my back.

24
00:03:30.585 --> 00:03:31.878
Let's turn to the letter of the law.

25
00:03:32.962 --> 00:03:33.922
It's useless.

26
00:03:34.005 --> 00:03:36.299
- Why?
- We have already received both

27
00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.260
more than our defined
according to the law, share of shares from mother.

28
00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.055
We will not receive a penny more.

29
00:03:42.138 --> 00:03:43.848
Okay, let me think.

30
00:03:44.432 --> 00:03:46.601
If we say that mom
had Alzheimer's disease?

31
00:03:46.684 --> 00:03:50.480
That her will is invalid,
because she was incapacitated?

32
00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:52.815
Lawyer Chong helped her.

33
00:03:53.316 --> 00:03:55.151
It has already been checked for legality.

34
00:03:56.444 --> 00:03:57.654
Devil!

35
00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.369
Austin! Justin!

36
00:04:04.452 --> 00:04:06.829
Come here you little rascals!

37
00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.750
What should we do now, dear?

38
00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:25.139
{\an8}12 YEARS AGO

39
00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:26.432
{\an8}Do everything according to the law.

40
00:04:27.225 --> 00:04:30.103
He must pay for what he did.

41
00:04:32.981 --> 00:04:34.899
I made a mistake because I was drunk.

42
00:04:36.192 --> 00:04:38.236
I didn't know it was a person!

43
00:04:40.029 --> 00:04:41.155
Mom!

44
00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:54.168
Mom...

45
00:04:55.795 --> 00:04:57.880
drives you into a dead end again.

46
00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:02.343
If she wanted it,

47
00:05:04.178 --> 00:05:05.263
then I will not lag behind.

48
00:05:41.215 --> 00:05:42.675
I'm pretty calm

49
00:05:43.301 --> 00:05:45.636
that is, I have already experienced it.

50
00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.514
Then why are you sitting in the back seat?

51
00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.478
This has always been my place.

52
00:05:54.062 --> 00:05:55.021
Then why do you…

53
00:05:55.104 --> 00:05:58.941
Perhaps you want to explain in detail,
why was my offer rejected

54
00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:00.943
but I'm not interested in that.

55
00:06:01.027 --> 00:06:04.322
- I wasn't going to explain...
- I've been sleeping badly lately.

56
00:06:04.405 --> 00:06:06.115
I was not myself

57
00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:09.660
and it was a rash decision
like in a dream

58
00:06:10.953 --> 00:06:14.082
just don't say
that they thought I was serious.

59
00:06:14.582 --> 00:06:15.416
Are you about certification?

60
00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:18.044
I wouldn't call it that loud.

61
00:06:18.127 --> 00:06:20.129
So what else to call the certificate?

62
00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.506
By accident.

63
00:06:21.589 --> 00:06:24.300
I would rather call it
minor accident.

64
00:06:24.383 --> 00:06:26.677
I don't care either way.

65
00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:30.681
What do you care?

66
00:06:31.265 --> 00:06:32.350
What do I call the case itself?

67
00:06:32.433 --> 00:06:33.851
Am I serious?

68
00:06:33.935 --> 00:06:35.228
Or the fact that I found out...

69
00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.110
That I was in a dream state?

70
00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:44.737
If I have to answer, then everything.

71
00:06:52.161 --> 00:06:53.287
Just turn on the music.

72
00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.667
Play uplifting music.

73
00:07:00.002 --> 00:07:02.296
{\an8}<i>Will I ever get married?</i>

74
00:07:04.507 --> 00:07:06.676
{\an8}<i>Will I ever get married?</i>

75
00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:08.928
{\an8}Next song.

76
00:07:09.512 --> 00:07:11.180
{\an8}<i>It's already the end of the year</i>

77
00:07:12.223 --> 00:07:16.144
{\an8}<i>I even thought of marrying you</i>

78
00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:17.937
{\an8}<i>- With own house</i>
- Next song.

79
00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.022
{\an8}<i>With our own room</i>

80
00:07:20.857 --> 00:07:23.818
{\an8}<i>Will you marry me...</i>

81
00:07:23.901 --> 00:07:27.071
{\an8}- Everyone is thinking about marriage.
- I'm not, I say!

82
00:07:27.155 --> 00:07:28.573
{\an8}<i>…the rest of life with me</i>

83
00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:32.660
{\an8}<i>The two of us...</i>

84
00:07:32.743 --> 00:07:34.245
{\an8}I want peace.

85
00:07:34.328 --> 00:07:36.247
{\an8}A moment ago you wanted music.

86
00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.832
{\an8}Please turn off the music.

87
00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:57.143
I will not allow what has happened now
interfere with the case, because I am calm.

88
00:07:57.852 --> 00:07:59.270
But you were not at all...

89
00:08:03.733 --> 00:08:05.401
{\an8}TO TO HI

90
00:08:14.577 --> 00:08:17.914
I don't hurt at all
probably because I'm not serious.

91
00:08:18.789 --> 00:08:21.959
It was just at that moment that I saw Jung Ku Won.

92
00:08:22.043 --> 00:08:23.169
And that's all...

93
00:08:25.254 --> 00:08:26.214
That is,

94
00:08:27.757 --> 00:08:30.468
if you weren't going to marry me
why were you courting?

95
00:08:30.551 --> 00:08:33.012
Why did they always appear before my eyes?

96
00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:38.851
If you do it again,

97
00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:43.231
then I will bring you to our wedding
with a zashmorg on the neck.

98
00:08:46.734 --> 00:08:47.985
TO TO HI

99
00:08:50.947 --> 00:08:54.075
No, it will work better
tranquilizer gun,

100
00:08:54.158 --> 00:08:55.910
because you are not human.

101
00:08:55.993 --> 00:08:57.245
I will use the one on the elephant.

102
00:08:57.828 --> 00:08:59.455
Just in the neck such a dose,

103
00:08:59.539 --> 00:09:00.623
to knock down the elephant.

104
00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:01.791
Boom.

105
00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.753
Better not to catch her eye yet.

106
00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:22.311
Jung Ku Won?

107
00:09:35.533 --> 00:09:36.784
<i>Can't believe it.</i>

108
00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.162
Aunt Jung Suk was killed because of an audit?
And now are you in danger?

109
00:09:40.246 --> 00:09:41.872
I have to find out who is behind this.

110
00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:43.332
To do this,

111
00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.168
I have to become the head
and create an audit group yourself.

112
00:09:46.252 --> 00:09:48.379
No, I think you better not get into it.

113
00:09:48.462 --> 00:09:49.964
You will run into even greater danger.

114
00:09:50.047 --> 00:09:51.924
I am equally in danger.

115
00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:55.595
I won't be safe
until the perpetrator is caught.

116
00:09:55.678 --> 00:09:56.887
Anyway, To Hee…

117
00:09:58.931 --> 00:10:00.182
It's my fault.

118
00:10:04.353 --> 00:10:05.521
seems to

119
00:10:06.522 --> 00:10:08.566
it all happened because of me.

120
00:10:10.318 --> 00:10:13.988
Mrs. Chu died,
trying to leave me my position.

121
00:10:15.823 --> 00:10:18.409
And I warned her that something was happening.

122
00:10:18.492 --> 00:10:19.952
You know it's not like that.

123
00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:23.372
It was bound to happen eventually.

124
00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:26.125
You have to blame the person
who killed her

125
00:10:26.208 --> 00:10:27.793
That's why I have to find out

126
00:10:28.669 --> 00:10:29.837
who did it

127
00:10:39.055 --> 00:10:39.972
However...

128
00:10:41.474 --> 00:10:43.601
A man at a funeral...

129
00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:46.687
This is the one you went with
on a blind date?

130
00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:48.856
Is his name Jung Ku Won?

131
00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:52.193
- Yes.
- I understand that you were in despair,

132
00:10:52.276 --> 00:10:55.905
and how did you think about marriage with a man
who were you on a date with?

133
00:10:57.239 --> 00:11:00.701
There is something more to it.

134
00:11:00.785 --> 00:11:02.328
Do you have feelings for him?

135
00:11:02.953 --> 00:11:04.205
Everything is wrong.

136
00:11:05.873 --> 00:11:08.751
He saved me many times.

137
00:11:10.503 --> 00:11:12.880
Is that why you hired him as a bodyguard?

138
00:11:15.383 --> 00:11:16.467
It is he

139
00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.804
best protects me

140
00:11:32.525 --> 00:11:33.359
you are back

141
00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:36.529
Why are you sitting in my office?

142
00:11:37.113 --> 00:11:39.657
Because your office is better than mine.

143
00:11:44.328 --> 00:11:45.704
Did you like the food?

144
00:11:45.788 --> 00:11:47.331
What do chaebols serve at a funeral?

145
00:11:49.166 --> 00:11:52.211
It was not a funeral, but a party.

146
00:11:53.462 --> 00:11:54.964
And also a party with a surprise.

147
00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:59.093
- What?
- Human greed knows no bounds.

148
00:11:59.176 --> 00:12:01.595
Now that I'm her bodyguard
wants to marry me

149
00:12:01.679 --> 00:12:04.181
- Who?
- Who else? To To Hee.

150
00:12:05.099 --> 00:12:07.017
She revealed herself to me today.

151
00:12:07.101 --> 00:12:08.144
What?

152
00:12:08.227 --> 00:12:09.228
Hold on.

153
00:12:09.311 --> 00:12:12.440
Is that movie true?

154
00:12:12.523 --> 00:12:13.691
What movie?

155
00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:16.485
"GUARDIAN"

156
00:12:16.569 --> 00:12:18.988
This is a film about a singer and her bodyguard.

157
00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:23.075
They hate each other at first
and then fall in love.

158
00:12:23.159 --> 00:12:24.452
Everything is wrong with us.

159
00:12:24.535 --> 00:12:27.246
To To Hee said she confessed
in a dream state.

160
00:12:27.329 --> 00:12:30.291
In such situations, people are usually more sincere.

161
00:12:30.374 --> 00:12:31.542
In a dream, drunk...

162
00:12:31.625 --> 00:12:34.628
Then they are less careful.

163
00:12:34.712 --> 00:12:36.297
She said it was not serious.

164
00:12:40.843 --> 00:12:42.052
"The first rule of the guard.

165
00:12:42.595 --> 00:12:43.846
Never let her out of your sight.

166
00:12:43.929 --> 00:12:45.139
The second rule.

167
00:12:45.222 --> 00:12:46.849
Never move away from her.

168
00:12:46.932 --> 00:12:47.766
The third rule.

169
00:12:49.226 --> 00:12:50.227
Never…

170
00:12:51.854 --> 00:12:54.607
don't fall in love with her."

171
00:12:57.151 --> 00:13:00.029
This is my favorite romantic movie.

172
00:13:00.112 --> 00:13:02.740
I had to become a bodyguard,
and not a butler.

173
00:13:02.823 --> 00:13:06.619
"No!"

174
00:13:07.661 --> 00:13:09.955
This is just a human delusion.

175
00:13:10.039 --> 00:13:11.874
What do you know as ignorant of love?

176
00:13:11.957 --> 00:13:13.125
I am not ignorant.

177
00:13:13.209 --> 00:13:15.044
I just don't care about such stupidity.

178
00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:16.212
Love is weakness.

179
00:13:16.295 --> 00:13:17.630
People are so stupid

180
00:13:17.713 --> 00:13:20.132
and love makes them even more stupid.

181
00:13:20.216 --> 00:13:23.302
You only say that because
that you lacked love.

182
00:13:23.385 --> 00:13:25.137
You would become a guardian, not a demon,

183
00:13:25.221 --> 00:13:27.973
- if you were loved.
- Don't talk about guardians.

184
00:13:30.059 --> 00:13:31.894
Stop and get back to work.

185
00:13:31.977 --> 00:13:33.354
Look at the piles of papers.

186
00:13:33.437 --> 00:13:34.897
I finished the work a long time ago.

187
00:13:36.607 --> 00:13:37.900
It's all your work.

188
00:13:39.944 --> 00:13:40.861
All?

189
00:13:43.239 --> 00:13:44.448
God

190
00:13:44.949 --> 00:13:47.868
You can't sleep on the couch.

191
00:13:47.952 --> 00:13:48.786
I won't.

192
00:13:49.286 --> 00:13:51.789
I will chat all night
so you can sleep

193
00:13:51.872 --> 00:13:53.165
I say, everything is fine.

194
00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:56.210
Do you think I can sleep
if I leave you alone now?

195
00:13:56.794 --> 00:13:58.754
No, so I better start.

196
00:13:59.338 --> 00:14:03.050
You know, I don't sleep
in the same house with another person.

197
00:14:03.133 --> 00:14:05.177
Then I'll be at the door.

198
00:14:06.428 --> 00:14:07.513
I was a Marine.

199
00:14:09.181 --> 00:14:11.016
I didn't have to tell you all that.

200
00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.769
From now on I won't tell you anything.

201
00:14:13.852 --> 00:14:16.355
Don't you dare do that.

202
00:14:16.438 --> 00:14:17.773
I'm just saying…

203
00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.152
Do you think I can sleep
if I know that you are not sleeping because of me?

204
00:14:23.028 --> 00:14:23.946
Yes?

205
00:14:25.447 --> 00:14:27.283
Good.

206
00:14:27.366 --> 00:14:28.200
take

207
00:14:32.162 --> 00:14:32.997
Here.

208
00:14:34.373 --> 00:14:36.667
I'm leaving, so sleep tight.

209
00:14:37.251 --> 00:14:40.045
I'll go dig through the papers
because I'm good at it.

210
00:14:40.963 --> 00:14:41.881
Thank you.

211
00:14:41.964 --> 00:14:45.926
thank you later
when you can sleep without worries.

212
00:14:47.845 --> 00:14:49.305
Yes. give me your phone

213
00:14:50.139 --> 00:14:51.932
Why do you need my phone?

214
00:14:53.392 --> 00:14:57.396
I will add myself as an emergency contact.

215
00:14:58.397 --> 00:14:59.773
THE KEEPER

216
00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:01.108
Here.

217
00:15:02.443 --> 00:15:04.445
Don't worry too much.

218
00:15:04.528 --> 00:15:05.946
There is good security here.

219
00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.407
Don't hide anything, and you shouldn't

220
00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.075
trying too hard to be okay.

221
00:15:10.159 --> 00:15:12.953
you can't be okay
considering what you've been through.

222
00:15:13.954 --> 00:15:15.039
I know I can't

223
00:15:15.706 --> 00:15:18.375
but i will do my best
to replace Aunt Jung Suk.

224
00:15:21.503 --> 00:15:23.464
You are definitely not capable.

225
00:15:25.299 --> 00:15:28.594
You should be much darker
to replace Ms. Chu.

226
00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:35.184
Call if something happens.

227
00:15:35.684 --> 00:15:36.518
Good.

228
00:15:37.394 --> 00:15:38.938
Something else.

229
00:15:39.021 --> 00:15:41.774
What did you say about the elephant earlier?

230
00:15:41.857 --> 00:15:42.816
An elephant?

231
00:15:45.778 --> 00:15:47.112
I don't mind.

232
00:15:47.196 --> 00:15:49.907
- I definitely heard you say...
- I'm so tired.

233
00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:53.077
- ...about cutting down an elephant.
- I'm going to sleep. Go already.

234
00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.745
- Thank you.
- Come on.

235
00:16:06.757 --> 00:16:07.883
I am completely alone again

236
00:16:09.593 --> 00:16:10.719
for the first time…

237
00:16:13.097 --> 00:16:14.431
for 17 years.

238
00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:23.399
Let's just move on to the next step.

239
00:16:23.482 --> 00:16:26.652
Probably, first I have
read Ms. Chu's letter.

240
00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:31.156
{\an8}GROUP CHAT: LEE NU LEE,
PAK SONG HYUNG, KIM SO YOUNG

241
00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.241
What is this?

242
00:16:33.909 --> 00:16:34.952
<i>Nice photos, To Hee.</i>

243
00:16:35.035 --> 00:16:38.205
<i>- Who is this guy?
- Who are you talking about? Show.</i>

244
00:16:38.789 --> 00:16:39.915
A guy?

245
00:16:44.545 --> 00:16:46.714
THE HEIRS OF "MIRE" REFUSED
WITH THE SPEED OF LIGHT

246
00:16:46.797 --> 00:16:49.258
What the hell is this?

247
00:16:54.263 --> 00:16:56.807
He does not believe that I have to
personally sign each document.

248
00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.642
After losing strength,

249
00:16:58.726 --> 00:17:01.061
life is so boring.

250
00:17:04.356 --> 00:17:06.233
What will you do with To To Hee?

251
00:17:06.316 --> 00:17:07.484
I'm talking about certification.

252
00:17:07.568 --> 00:17:10.070
I'm not so crazy that even
marry her, not just guard her.

253
00:17:13.198 --> 00:17:16.869
For the demon, the perfect predator,
to marry an insignificant person

254
00:17:17.453 --> 00:17:20.205
the same as for a carnivore
marry a pig

255
00:17:20.789 --> 00:17:22.958
Is this how animals feel?

256
00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:26.879
Sorry, pigs, chickens and sometimes cows.

257
00:17:26.962 --> 00:17:28.338
Don't overextend yourself.

258
00:17:29.006 --> 00:17:31.884
I just have to hold on
until the next full moon

259
00:17:31.967 --> 00:17:34.011
and become a perfect self again.

260
00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.055
I finally finished.

261
00:17:38.182 --> 00:17:39.558
The man To To Hee confessed to.

262
00:17:40.642 --> 00:17:41.602
It's you, isn't it?

263
00:17:41.685 --> 00:17:42.895
{\an8}THE HEIRS OF "MIRE" REFUSED
WITH THE SPEED OF LIGHT

264
00:17:42.978 --> 00:17:45.939
Calm down and put your sword down first.

265
00:17:46.857 --> 00:17:48.901
She's totally crazy, isn't she?

266
00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:56.742
She's so crazy

267
00:17:56.825 --> 00:17:59.244
And she is just in time.

268
00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.333
<i>We must see each other immediately!</i>

269
00:18:15.803 --> 00:18:19.306
Why are you wearing black glasses in the evening?
Do you consider yourself a celebrity or something?

270
00:18:19.389 --> 00:18:20.474
I am her.

271
00:18:20.557 --> 00:18:22.351
Ви зробили мене знаменитістю за мить.

272
00:18:22.434 --> 00:18:23.852
How can I not wear them?

273
00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:28.148
They hid the wrong face.

274
00:18:28.232 --> 00:18:29.733
З моїм у них було б більше…

275
00:18:29.817 --> 00:18:32.069
То чому ви відмовили зі швидкістю світла?

276
00:18:32.152 --> 00:18:33.946
Певно, вас злякав мій статус,

277
00:18:34.029 --> 00:18:36.281
не хотіли здаватися снобом,
immediately agreeing.

278
00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:38.325
Я все це розумію, бо я спокійна.

279
00:18:38.992 --> 00:18:40.077
However,

280
00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:42.996
I will be grateful for the explanation.

281
00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:45.874
As I said, I plan
to remain unmarried.

282
00:18:48.127 --> 00:18:49.878
me too

283
00:18:49.962 --> 00:18:51.547
Добре, забудьмо, що щось було.

284
00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.550
Дякую, що запропонували забути те,
why am i so embarrassed

285
00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:56.677
але про це вже знає весь світ.

286
00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:58.595
But why me?

287
00:18:59.429 --> 00:19:02.224
Чому з усіх присутніх ви обрали мене?

288
00:19:02.307 --> 00:19:03.142
This is…

289
00:19:06.687 --> 00:19:08.230
Don't say I heard the truth.

290
00:19:09.022 --> 00:19:11.316
Like in that movie...

291
00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.569
- What are you talking about?
- I heard

292
00:19:13.652 --> 00:19:15.362
that in a dream people are more sincere.

293
00:19:15.445 --> 00:19:16.905
I'm not serious!

294
00:19:18.407 --> 00:19:22.744
Тоді чого я маю підігрувати
вашим незрозумілим забаганкам?

295
00:19:23.412 --> 00:19:26.665
Знайдіть іншого, з ким поберетеся,
no questions

296
00:19:26.748 --> 00:19:27.708
Don't worry.

297
00:19:27.791 --> 00:19:29.710
Even if we were the last man on Earth,

298
00:19:29.793 --> 00:19:31.628
I would never marry you.

299
00:19:32.462 --> 00:19:33.589
What a relief.

300
00:19:36.884 --> 00:19:39.261
Did you just turn me down again?

301
00:19:39.344 --> 00:19:41.013
Got rejected twice in one day?

302
00:19:41.096 --> 00:19:43.098
- I will give you a ride.
- Leave it!

303
00:19:43.182 --> 00:19:44.850
And if they attack again with acid?

304
00:19:49.396 --> 00:19:50.480
Start the car.

305
00:20:00.657 --> 00:20:02.743
It's all your name's fault.

306
00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.414
First by the sea,

307
00:20:08.498 --> 00:20:09.583
and now today

308
00:20:11.877 --> 00:20:13.253
"Salvation".

309
00:20:14.588 --> 00:20:16.131
It is too sweet.

310
00:20:19.092 --> 00:20:21.345
I thought I needed to sleep to be honest.

311
00:20:21.845 --> 00:20:23.388
That's because it's not real.

312
00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.184
Fake is always sweeter.

313
00:20:28.602 --> 00:20:29.686
Salvation,

314
00:20:30.604 --> 00:20:32.231
love, happiness, etc.

315
00:20:33.065 --> 00:20:34.900
Sweet is harmful.

316
00:20:35.817 --> 00:20:37.945
And you know what is the worst?

317
00:20:40.447 --> 00:20:41.448
Happiness.

318
00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:47.120
People become unhappy
because they are trying to be happy.

319
00:20:51.166 --> 00:20:53.710
That's why I don't try to be happy.

320
00:20:54.586 --> 00:20:56.380
If the goal of your life is not happiness,

321
00:20:57.798 --> 00:20:59.716
why do you work so hard

322
00:21:01.843 --> 00:21:04.471
Just out of habit.

323
00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:08.767
After the death of parents, it seemed

324
00:21:09.518 --> 00:21:13.397
that I will drown if I don't work hard.

325
00:21:14.731 --> 00:21:18.986
In sadness, guilt and self-pity

326
00:21:19.069 --> 00:21:20.279
etc.

327
00:21:22.197 --> 00:21:23.782
And did not look back

328
00:21:23.865 --> 00:21:25.742
as it became a habit.

329
00:22:04.197 --> 00:22:06.491
What the hell? Damn it!

330
00:22:14.041 --> 00:22:15.167
How pathetic.

331
00:22:24.676 --> 00:22:26.803
TO TO HI

332
00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:51.578
What happened?

333
00:22:52.079 --> 00:22:54.539
You snored so loudly.

334
00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:56.666
I?

335
00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:57.584
We have arrived.

336
00:23:04.841 --> 00:23:06.301
I must be very tired.

337
00:23:06.384 --> 00:23:07.761
I don't normally snore.

338
00:23:08.804 --> 00:23:11.264
I don't want them to go out alone
and got into trouble

339
00:23:11.348 --> 00:23:12.891
so call me if you need to.

340
00:23:12.974 --> 00:23:14.309
Although they would rather not call.

341
00:23:36.832 --> 00:23:38.583
PERSONAL INFORMATION
TO TO HI

342
00:23:39.292 --> 00:23:40.752
{\an8}ADD EMERGENCY CONTACT

343
00:23:42.254 --> 00:23:44.339
SAVIOR KU WON

344
00:23:47.926 --> 00:23:49.636
MOTHER, FATHER, BROTHER,
SISTER, SON, DAUGHTER,

345
00:23:49.719 --> 00:23:50.929
FRIEND, HUSBAND, PARTNER,
SECRETARY, MANAGER...

346
00:23:52.055 --> 00:23:53.431
After all, he is my bodyguard.

347
00:23:54.307 --> 00:23:56.184
I have to give up personal matters.

348
00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:58.019
{\an8}KEEPING: SOK HOON
MANAGER: SAVIOR KU WON

349
00:24:09.823 --> 00:24:11.825
TO TO HI

350
00:24:22.586 --> 00:24:23.712
{\an8}<i>Dear To Hee.</i>

351
00:24:26.631 --> 00:24:27.674
Ms. Chu.

352
00:24:29.759 --> 00:24:32.179
<i>If you're reading this,</i>

353
00:24:33.638 --> 00:24:38.018
{\an8}<i>that means I left you alone again.</i>

354
00:24:39.978 --> 00:24:43.106
<i>I'm not too interested,
how my life will end.</i>

355
00:24:45.358 --> 00:24:49.487
<i>But I only hope
that my death will not hurt you.</i>

356
00:24:50.405 --> 00:24:51.364
<i>What...</i>

357
00:24:52.574 --> 00:24:54.242
<i>you will be able to survive it,</i>

358
00:24:54.826 --> 00:24:57.245
<i>like a mischievous joke.</i>

359
00:25:00.665 --> 00:25:02.250
<i>Therefore, To Hee,</i>

360
00:25:03.168 --> 00:25:06.838
<i>it is enough to cry once.</i>

361
00:25:14.554 --> 00:25:17.098
<i>I leave you in position</i>

362
00:25:17.807 --> 00:25:21.645
<i>on the battlefield, where tears have no place.</i>

363
00:25:23.480 --> 00:25:24.606
FAMILY CONSENT FORM

364
00:25:24.689 --> 00:25:27.192
{\an8}WE CONSENT TO THE AUTOPSY

365
00:25:29.444 --> 00:25:30.987
<i>I didn't manage.</i>

366
00:25:32.030 --> 00:25:34.366
<i>Perhaps I am considered successful,</i>

367
00:25:35.617 --> 00:25:36.785
<i>but I am surrounded</i>

368
00:25:37.327 --> 00:25:42.415
<i>rotten people who remind me
about my complete failure.</i>

369
00:25:44.793 --> 00:25:46.711
<i>Perhaps you are interested,</i>

370
00:25:46.795 --> 00:25:49.839
<i>why do I demand marriage from you,
so that you become the head.</i>

371
00:25:51.132 --> 00:25:52.926
<i>This position</i>

372
00:25:53.718 --> 00:25:55.512
<i>incredibly lonely.</i>

373
00:25:58.056 --> 00:26:01.685
<i>I felt it to the core,
because all this time she was alone.</i>

374
00:26:04.312 --> 00:26:05.730
<i>Without you</i>

375
00:26:06.523 --> 00:26:11.820
<i>I would drown in the hell of this loneliness.</i>

376
00:26:14.864 --> 00:26:16.533
<i>I will not let you survive</i>

377
00:26:17.993 --> 00:26:20.036
<i>the hell in which I lived.</i>

378
00:26:21.329 --> 00:26:22.247
<i>Therefore...</i>

379
00:26:23.290 --> 00:26:25.292
<i>if you are determined to take my place,</i>

380
00:26:26.084 --> 00:26:28.003
<i>be sure to find the one</i>

381
00:26:29.296 --> 00:26:32.340
<i>who will be next to you and on your side.</i>

382
00:26:34.092 --> 00:26:36.011
{\an8}THE LATE CHU CHONG SUK

383
00:26:36.594 --> 00:26:38.430
<i>If you cannot find such a person,</i>

384
00:26:38.513 --> 00:26:41.808
<i>just give the post to the wolves</i>

385
00:26:42.559 --> 00:26:44.185
<i>and save yourself.</i>

386
00:26:45.061 --> 00:26:48.940
<i>It's the only thing I can do,</i>

387
00:26:49.858 --> 00:26:52.068
<i>leaving you in a den of wolves.</i>

388
00:26:56.072 --> 00:26:57.949
I understand your intentions, Ms. Chu.

389
00:26:58.908 --> 00:27:01.953
But you trust me, don't you?

390
00:27:03.496 --> 00:27:05.040
I can do just fine on my own.

391
00:27:28.146 --> 00:27:30.273
HERE LIES A LEGEND
CHWE TOK HO

392
00:27:41.826 --> 00:27:44.412
{\an8}We do not have the right to shed a single tear,

393
00:27:44.496 --> 00:27:46.623
until we avenge the death of the boss!

394
00:27:47.207 --> 00:27:50.502
We will present the head of that scoundrel to the boss!

395
00:27:50.585 --> 00:27:51.878
Despite everything!

396
00:27:56.633 --> 00:27:59.469
Sir, I have a clue
about that scoundrel from the restaurant.

397
00:27:59.552 --> 00:28:02.472
His name is Jung Ku Won,
and i have his credit card number.

398
00:28:02.555 --> 00:28:03.390
And look.

399
00:28:09.896 --> 00:28:11.106
No video only then.

400
00:28:11.189 --> 00:28:14.984
Employees knew nothing
so it's not their fault.

401
00:28:17.028 --> 00:28:19.739
Who the hell is that scumbag?

402
00:28:34.379 --> 00:28:35.672
Good morning, young sir.

403
00:28:36.881 --> 00:28:38.800
Have a wonderful day, young Mr. Yi Sune.

404
00:28:39.300 --> 00:28:40.135
Young man!

405
00:29:09.956 --> 00:29:12.000
Good morning, Director Jon.

406
00:29:15.128 --> 00:29:16.880
- Mr. Pak.
- What?

407
00:29:19.299 --> 00:29:22.302
My memories are starting to come back
about the time when I was human.

408
00:29:27.182 --> 00:29:30.143
Yi Sun? You don't know the last name?

409
00:29:30.226 --> 00:29:31.644
Everyone called me that.

410
00:29:32.854 --> 00:29:34.773
Should I investigate this?

411
00:29:36.107 --> 00:29:39.027
I can find aristocrats
of the Joseon Dynasty named Yi Sung.

412
00:29:39.110 --> 00:29:40.987
I don't know if it will be useful for me

413
00:29:41.738 --> 00:29:43.531
to find out who I was when I was human.

414
00:29:43.615 --> 00:29:44.908
I'm not even sure it's me.

415
00:29:44.991 --> 00:29:46.409
And what do you lose?

416
00:29:46.993 --> 00:29:49.496
Let me search. Kim Yi Sun?
Park Yi Sun? How can it be?

417
00:29:49.579 --> 00:29:53.124
But why your memories
suddenly return after 200 years?

418
00:29:57.378 --> 00:29:59.255
- What?
- Without your strength

419
00:29:59.339 --> 00:30:01.549
you're pretty much nothing… i.e. you're human.

420
00:30:01.633 --> 00:30:03.384
That's probably why they keep coming back.

421
00:30:03.468 --> 00:30:04.719
Now you are human.

422
00:30:04.803 --> 00:30:06.679
And what? What is it?

423
00:30:06.763 --> 00:30:10.558
That is, you are mortal, like everyone else.

424
00:30:10.642 --> 00:30:13.478
Accidents pose a greater threat,
than spontaneous combustion.

425
00:30:13.561 --> 00:30:16.272
Goodbye, eternal life. Hello, aging.

426
00:30:16.356 --> 00:30:17.190
Aging?

427
00:30:19.776 --> 00:30:21.528
You will look like me very soon.

428
00:30:21.611 --> 00:30:23.029
No!

429
00:30:23.112 --> 00:30:24.322
This should not happen.

430
00:30:24.405 --> 00:30:26.407
It can't be.

431
00:30:27.242 --> 00:30:28.868
Can't believe it. My face…

432
00:30:28.952 --> 00:30:30.578
Here... and here...

433
00:30:32.539 --> 00:30:33.623
No.

434
00:30:33.706 --> 00:30:34.624
My dad

435
00:30:35.208 --> 00:30:36.960
I have to get my tattoo back.

436
00:30:37.502 --> 00:30:38.545
Ahead.

437
00:30:41.589 --> 00:30:43.925
CHIEF CHU DIED OF A HEART ATTACK
THE FAMILY SAYS GOODBYE IN TEARS

438
00:30:50.223 --> 00:30:51.808
Give me the wrist. Quick.

439
00:31:01.276 --> 00:31:02.610
Weren't you going to do something?

440
00:31:02.694 --> 00:31:05.530
- No.
- Then why are you holding my wrist.

441
00:31:05.613 --> 00:31:06.614
How do I say it?

442
00:31:06.698 --> 00:31:07.949
It gives me peace.

443
00:31:08.032 --> 00:31:09.534
Let's stay like this from now on.

444
00:31:13.037 --> 00:31:14.163
I can't

445
00:31:15.123 --> 00:31:16.833
I have to maintain an image.

446
00:31:17.500 --> 00:31:20.879
Today you refused me
not once, but twice the speed of light.

447
00:31:20.962 --> 00:31:22.797
If you let me hold my wrist

448
00:31:22.881 --> 00:31:24.465
what will they think of me?

449
00:31:24.549 --> 00:31:26.092
Are you calm?

450
00:31:26.175 --> 00:31:27.510
I'm not calm.

451
00:31:27.594 --> 00:31:29.971
Actually, I'm so restless that I'm boiling.

452
00:31:30.054 --> 00:31:31.431
This is your chance to be calm.

453
00:31:31.514 --> 00:31:34.017
Be calm. I will live as I want.

454
00:31:34.100 --> 00:31:36.853
This applies to both of us.

455
00:31:36.936 --> 00:31:40.231
Arthritis may not give me
to save you in the future.

456
00:31:40.315 --> 00:31:41.149
Arthritis?

457
00:31:41.232 --> 00:31:44.527
It is unpleasant to define
but without my powers I am just a man.

458
00:31:44.611 --> 00:31:47.488
That is, time is no longer my ally.

459
00:31:47.572 --> 00:31:48.406
And what?

460
00:31:48.489 --> 00:31:50.825
I will get old like all of you.

461
00:31:54.078 --> 00:31:55.413
you say

462
00:31:55.496 --> 00:31:59.292
that you want to hold my wrist
because you are afraid that you will grow old?

463
00:31:59.375 --> 00:32:01.252
Yes, is it clear now?

464
00:32:03.004 --> 00:32:03.880
No.

465
00:32:03.963 --> 00:32:05.214
What this time?

466
00:32:05.298 --> 00:32:07.342
treat me
as for wireless charging.

467
00:32:07.425 --> 00:32:09.385
And you treat me like a pokemon.

468
00:32:09.469 --> 00:32:10.678
Demon, pokemon. The same thing.

469
00:32:11.346 --> 00:32:13.139
To sneeze, people are ignorant.

470
00:32:13.973 --> 00:32:15.725
Then I won't be your bodyguard.

471
00:32:17.018 --> 00:32:17.894
As you wish.

472
00:32:17.977 --> 00:32:21.397
If I die, your precious daddy
will disappear with me

473
00:32:22.732 --> 00:32:24.067
Is this a threat?

474
00:32:24.150 --> 00:32:25.526
You want to be freed.

475
00:32:25.610 --> 00:32:27.612
Why can't you just recharge me?

476
00:32:29.072 --> 00:32:30.657
I can't do this all the time.

477
00:32:31.240 --> 00:32:32.116
Then when?

478
00:32:53.012 --> 00:32:54.430
Good times.

479
00:32:55.723 --> 00:32:57.016
Good times

480
00:32:58.434 --> 00:33:01.729
always painfully short.

481
00:33:12.782 --> 00:33:13.783
God!

482
00:33:14.867 --> 00:33:16.077
My treasure...

483
00:33:16.160 --> 00:33:17.912
I'm sorry.

484
00:33:22.750 --> 00:33:24.293
I don't have any cash.

485
00:33:25.003 --> 00:33:26.295
No?

486
00:33:26.379 --> 00:33:27.213
No.

487
00:33:29.007 --> 00:33:30.675
{\an8}You can always transfer funds.

488
00:33:30.758 --> 00:33:31.968
{\an8}JESUS CORPORATION
BANK "TEKUN"

489
00:33:32.051 --> 00:33:32.885
"MIRE NUTRITION"

490
00:33:32.969 --> 00:33:33.803
<i>Good morning.</i>

491
00:33:33.886 --> 00:33:36.305
- Good morning.
- "Good morning"?

492
00:33:36.389 --> 00:33:39.809
how can you say that
when did our head die?

493
00:33:39.892 --> 00:33:42.979
Let's face it. you never
and did not speak with her personally.

494
00:33:43.062 --> 00:33:45.481
I think there is no point in pretending to be sad.

495
00:33:45.565 --> 00:33:47.900
There is no point in being successful

496
00:33:47.984 --> 00:33:50.653
and create connections around the world?

497
00:33:51.738 --> 00:33:53.239
Life is fleeting.

498
00:33:54.073 --> 00:33:55.116
Regarding this,

499
00:33:55.199 --> 00:33:56.826
don't want to have dinner as a team?

500
00:33:56.909 --> 00:33:59.162
According to my prediction now
bad day for company.

501
00:33:59.245 --> 00:34:02.415
Why is every day bad for society?

502
00:34:09.964 --> 00:34:11.049
No.

503
00:34:35.156 --> 00:34:38.659
<i>You are getting old as we speak.</i>

504
00:34:53.382 --> 00:34:55.676
Mrs. To has arrived. smile

505
00:35:00.723 --> 00:35:01.849
Mrs. Sin.

506
00:35:01.933 --> 00:35:04.560
What about the one I'm really with
should I go on a date?

507
00:35:06.938 --> 00:35:09.690
That is, with the one with whom I could not
meet last time

508
00:35:09.774 --> 00:35:11.567
because it is not stuck with that.

509
00:35:11.651 --> 00:35:13.152
Organize a meeting?

510
00:35:13.236 --> 00:35:14.195
As soon as possible.

511
00:35:14.278 --> 00:35:15.738
Yes, ma'am.

512
00:35:15.822 --> 00:35:19.242
And I found the records you asked for.

513
00:35:21.410 --> 00:35:22.620
CAMERA RECORDS FROM HOME

514
00:35:22.703 --> 00:35:23.663
What is this?

515
00:35:24.163 --> 00:35:27.875
Ms. Chu died of an allergy to medication
on the day she requested the audit.

516
00:35:27.959 --> 00:35:29.627
Since the medicine was in her bag,

517
00:35:30.253 --> 00:35:32.672
must have been filmed by the cameras
how someone replaces them.

518
00:35:33.548 --> 00:35:35.550
You will have to watch them forever.

519
00:35:36.050 --> 00:35:37.426
Good luck

520
00:35:38.136 --> 00:35:38.970
did you forget

